<dialog
  class="admin-dialog tool-delete-dialog"
  data-management-delete-dialog
  aria-labelledby="management-delete-title"
  aria-describedby="management-delete-description"
>
  <h2 id="management-delete-title" data-management-delete-title>
    ツールを削除
  </h2>
  <p class="tool-delete-question" data-management-delete-question></p>
  <p id="management-delete-description" data-management-delete-description>
    質問・選択肢・回答・添付ファイル・関連するサイト内通知を削除します。共有リンクからも閲覧できなくなります。この操作は取り消せません。
  </p>
  <form data-management-delete-form>
    <label class="tool-check"
      ><input
        type="checkbox"
        name="confirmation"
        value="delete"
        required
      />削除する内容を確認しました</label
    >
    <div class="activity-actions">
      <button type="button" data-management-delete-cancel autofocus>戻る</button
      >
      <button class="admin-button" type="submit">削除を確定</button>
    </div>
    <p data-management-delete-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </form>
</dialog>
<script>
  import "../scripts/managementDelete";
</script>
<style>
  .tool-delete-dialog {
    opacity: 1;
    transition: none;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: min(640px, calc(100vw - 32px));
    max-height: 88dvh;
    overflow: auto;
  }
  .tool-delete-dialog::backdrop { opacity: 1; transition: none; }
  .tool-delete-dialog h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
  }
  .tool-delete-question {
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    max-height: 24dvh;
    overflow: auto;
    border-block: 1px solid #d5d0ca;
    padding: 16px 0;
  }
  .tool-delete-dialog .tool-check {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .tool-delete-dialog form {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .tool-delete-dialog [data-management-delete-status]:empty {
    display: none;
  }
</style>
